:Namespace CS
⍝ CongaSharp — APL Cover Functions (DWA Kit)
⍝ Wraps the congasharp.dll native exports using LOCALP (PP) parameters.
⍝
⍝ All functions match real Conga (DRC) result shapes where possible:
⍝   Init      → handle (scalar)
⍝   Srv       → (rc objName)
⍝   Clt       → (rc objName) or (rc errName errMsg) on connect failure
⍝   Wait      → (rc objName eventType data)
⍝   Send      → (rc resolvedHandle)
⍝   Respond   → rc (scalar)
⍝   Progress  → rc (scalar)
⍝   Close     → rc (scalar)
⍝   Exists    → rc (scalar: 0=exists, 1002=not found)
⍝   Names     → nested string vector
⍝   SetProp   → rc (scalar)
⍝   GetProp   → (rc value)
⍝   Shutdown  → rc (scalar)
⍝
⍝ Usage:
⍝   CS.Bind ''                               ⍝ Bind ⎕NA (pass DLL path or '' for default)
⍝   h←CS.Init ⍬                              ⍝ Initialise, returns handle
⍝   CS.Srv h '' '' 8080 'Command'            ⍝ Create + start server
⍝   CS.Clt h '' '127.0.0.1' 8080 'Command'   ⍝ Create + connect client
⍝   CS.Wait h '.' 5000                        ⍝ Wait for next event
⍝   CS.Send h 'CLT00000000' data              ⍝ Send data
⍝   CS.Respond h 'SRV0.CON0.Cmd' data         ⍝ Respond to command
⍝   CS.Close h 'SRV00000000'                  ⍝ Close an object
⍝   CS.Shutdown h                              ⍝ Shutdown root

    ⎕IO←0 ⋄ ⎕ML←1

    ∇ path←DefaultDllPath
    ⍝ Override this to point to your published congasharp.dll
      path←'C:\Users\stf\Source\Repos\Conga-Sharp\src\CongaSharp\bin\Release\net10.0\win-x64\publish\congasharp.dll'
    ∇

    ⍝ ── ⎕NA Declarations ──────────────────────────────────────

    ∇ Bind dllPath;dll
    ⍝ Bind all ⎕NA declarations. Call once before using any CS function.
    ⍝ dllPath: full path to congasharp.dll, or '' to use DefaultDllPath
      :If 0=≢dllPath ⋄ dll←DefaultDllPath ⋄ :Else ⋄ dll←dllPath ⋄ :EndIf
      ⍝ Lifecycle
      ⎕NA'P ',dll,'|conga_pp_init'
      ⎕NA'I4 ',dll,'|conga_pp_shutdown P'
      ⎕NA dll,'|conga_pp_version >PP'
      ⍝ Server
      ⎕NA dll,'|conga_pp_srv_create P <PP <PP I4 <PP I4 >PP'
      ⎕NA'I4 ',dll,'|conga_pp_srv_start P <PP'
      ⍝ Client
      ⎕NA dll,'|conga_pp_clt_create P <PP <PP I4 <PP I4 >PP'
      ⎕NA'I4 ',dll,'|conga_pp_clt_connect P <PP I4'
      ⍝ Events
      ⎕NA dll,'|conga_pp_wait P <PP I4 >PP'
      ⍝ Data
      ⎕NA dll,'|conga_pp_send P <PP <PP I4 I4 I4 >PP'
      ⎕NA'I4 ',dll,'|conga_pp_respond P <PP <PP I4'
      ⎕NA'I4 ',dll,'|conga_pp_progress P <PP <PP I4'
      ⍝ Management
      ⎕NA'I4 ',dll,'|conga_pp_close P <PP'
      ⎕NA'I4 ',dll,'|conga_pp_exists P <PP'
      ⎕NA dll,'|conga_pp_names P <PP >PP'
      ⎕NA'I4 ',dll,'|conga_pp_setprop P <PP <PP <PP'
      ⎕NA'I4 ',dll,'|conga_pp_getprop P <PP <PP >PP'
    ∇

    ⍝ ── Lifecycle ─────────────────────────────────────────────

    ∇ r←Init dummy
    ⍝ Initialise a new CongaSharp root. Returns the opaque handle.
      r←conga_pp_init
    ∇

    ∇ r←Shutdown h
    ⍝ Shutdown a root: closes all objects, releases resources.
    ⍝ Returns: rc (0=success)
      r←conga_pp_shutdown h
    ∇

    ∇ r←Version
    ⍝ Returns the library version string.
      r←conga_pp_version 0
    ∇

    ⍝ ── Server ────────────────────────────────────────────────

    ∇ r←Srv args;h;name;addr;port;mode;buf;rc
    ⍝ Create and start a server (3-phase: create → start).
    ⍝ args: h name addr port mode [bufSize]
    ⍝ Returns: (0 objName) on success, (errcode '') on failure
      (h name addr port mode)←5↑args
      buf←(5⊃args,16384)
      r←conga_pp_srv_create h name addr port mode buf 0
      :If 0=⊃r
          rc←conga_pp_srv_start h(1⊃r)
          :If rc≠0
              {}conga_pp_close h(1⊃r)
              r←rc ''
          :EndIf
      :EndIf
    ∇

    ∇ r←SrvCreate args;h;name;addr;port;mode;buf
    ⍝ Phase 1 only: create server without starting.
    ⍝ args: h name addr port mode [bufSize]
    ⍝ Returns: (rc objName)
      (h name addr port mode)←5↑args
      buf←(5⊃args,16384)
      r←conga_pp_srv_create h name addr port mode buf 0
    ∇

    ∇ r←SrvStart(h name)
    ⍝ Phase 3: start a previously created server.
    ⍝ Returns: rc
      r←conga_pp_srv_start h name
    ∇

    ⍝ ── Client ────────────────────────────────────────────────

    ∇ r←Clt args;h;name;addr;port;mode;buf;timeout;rc
    ⍝ Create and connect a client (3-phase: create → connect).
    ⍝ args: h name addr port mode [bufSize [timeout]]
    ⍝ Returns: (0 objName) on success, (errcode '') on failure
      (h name addr port mode)←5↑args
      buf←(5⊃args,16384)
      timeout←(6⊃args,5000)
      r←conga_pp_clt_create h name addr port mode buf 0
      :If 0=⊃r
          rc←conga_pp_clt_connect h(1⊃r)timeout
          :If rc≠0
              {}conga_pp_close h(1⊃r)
              r←rc ''
          :EndIf
      :EndIf
    ∇

    ∇ r←CltCreate args;h;name;addr;port;mode;buf
    ⍝ Phase 1 only: create client without connecting.
    ⍝ args: h name addr port mode [bufSize]
    ⍝ Returns: (rc objName)
      (h name addr port mode)←5↑args
      buf←(5⊃args,16384)
      r←conga_pp_clt_create h name addr port mode buf 0
    ∇

    ∇ r←CltConnect(h name timeout)
    ⍝ Phase 3: connect a previously created client.
    ⍝ Returns: rc
      r←conga_pp_clt_connect h name timeout
    ∇

    ⍝ ── Events ────────────────────────────────────────────────

    ∇ r←Wait(h name timeout)
    ⍝ Wait for the next event.
    ⍝ Returns: (rc objName eventType data)
    ⍝   Timeout:    (0 '.' 'Timeout' 100)
    ⍝   Receive:    (0 'SRV0.CON0' 'Receive' byteData)
    ⍝   Connect:    (0 'SRV0.CON0' 'Connect' '')
    ⍝   Closed:     (0 'SRV0.CON0' 'Closed' 1119)
      r←conga_pp_wait h name timeout 0
    ∇

    ⍝ ── Data ──────────────────────────────────────────────────

    ∇ r←Send(h name data)
    ⍝ Send data on a connection.
    ⍝ data must be a byte vector (use 1(220⌶)value to convert).
    ⍝ Returns: (rc resolvedHandle)
      r←conga_pp_send h name data 0 0 0 0
    ∇

    ∇ r←SendEx(h name data closeFlag compression track)
    ⍝ Extended send with close flag, compression, and tracking.
    ⍝ closeFlag: 0=none, 1=close connection, 2=close command
    ⍝ compression: 0=none, 1=Deflate, 2=LZ4, 3=Zstd
    ⍝ track: 0=no mailbox, 1=register mailbox for response routing
    ⍝ Returns: (rc resolvedHandle)
      r←conga_pp_send h name data closeFlag compression track 0
    ∇

    ∇ r←Respond(h name data)
    ⍝ Send final response for a command (server-side).
    ⍝ Returns: rc
      r←conga_pp_respond h name data 0
    ∇

    ∇ r←RespondEx(h name data compression)
    ⍝ Respond with compression.
    ⍝ Returns: rc
      r←conga_pp_respond h name data compression
    ∇

    ∇ r←Progress(h name data)
    ⍝ Send interim progress message for a command (server-side).
    ⍝ Returns: rc
      r←conga_pp_progress h name data 0
    ∇

    ∇ r←ProgressEx(h name data compression)
    ⍝ Progress with compression.
    ⍝ Returns: rc
      r←conga_pp_progress h name data compression
    ∇

    ⍝ ── Management ────────────────────────────────────────────

    ∇ r←Close(h name)
    ⍝ Close a named object and all its children.
    ⍝ Returns: rc (0=success, 1002=not found)
      r←conga_pp_close h name
    ∇

    ∇ r←Exists(h name)
    ⍝ Check if a name exists in the registry.
    ⍝ Returns: rc (0=exists, 1002=not found)
      r←conga_pp_exists h name
    ∇

    ∇ r←Names(h obj)
    ⍝ Get child names of an object.
    ⍝ Returns: nested string vector
      r←conga_pp_names h obj 0
    ∇

    ⍝ ── Properties ────────────────────────────────────────────

    ∇ r←SetProp(h obj prop value)
    ⍝ Set a property. value should be a JSON string (e.g., '"hello"', '42', '[1,2]').
    ⍝ Returns: rc
      r←conga_pp_setprop h obj prop value
    ∇

    ∇ r←GetProp(h obj prop)
    ⍝ Get a property value.
    ⍝ Returns: (rc jsonString)
      r←conga_pp_getprop h obj prop 0
    ∇

:EndNamespace
